# member-answers: the bot as members meet it. Its system prompt and handbook come from the arm's bundle
# (bot/), so a change to either is a new bundle; the member's question goes in as they would type it.
# model before provider: nb builds the provider's client as soon as it reads `provider`.
model {{model}}
provider {{provider}}
harness {{harness}}
tools none
system @{{bundle}}/system.md
system @{{bundle}}/knowledge.md
run {{prompt}}
